                text: '复用[操作范围页](/zh/docs/store-middleware/actions-and-mutation-boundaries)的 order-state.ts。shutdown.ts 关闭真实绑定后继续通过 Store.$set 更新数量，再由 finally 释放 Store，不声称中间件拥有运行时。'
