                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'For multiple instances of a plugin set, use `defineTrayHost` and `createTray`. Their creation options, calling objects, and instance lifecycle are covered in [Host instances](/en/docs/tray/instances-and-routing). Static Graph has no spawn, restart, or routing API.'
