                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Import these helpers from `@migaia/lifecycle/errors`. Root exports `LifecycleErrorCode` and `LifecycleErrorText` for stable codes and messages. Business failures use their own package codes rather than borrowing lifecycle codes.'
