                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'A thenable is an object or function with callable `then`, including a Promise. Import `probeThenable()`, `assimilateCapturedThen()`, `IThenableProbe`, and `ThenableProbeKind` from `@migaia/utils/function`.'
